A||||35||batboy||invisible Fiero||||1||
Z||000000||batboy||06-09-2000||09:48 PM||||I went to lunch and back to work today, about the same as I always do, except this time my 85 GT must of turned invisible. Two different cars at different times pulled out in front of me, which annoyed me. Then a backwards hat baggy pants punk in a riced out Geo Metro came roaring up and cut me off as he switched lanes right in front of me...I tested the brakes in a panic stop plus layed on the horn. Got back under control and flew up next to him to give him the one finger salute and this mental midget tries to race me...my gawd! A 3 cylinder Geo! I blow by him and now I'm getting whizzed off big time. I eat my lunch and cool down a little.<P>I'm driving back to work and some lady with kids in a minivan makes a right turn on a red light without stopping, right out in front of me while I'm doing 45 MPH. I smoke the brakes again. The blood pressure goes up into the danger zone. I use my horn as an educational tool the whole time I pass her. Then, to top it all off, one more crazy pulls out in front of me before I get back to the office. By now, I'm building up to a full blown case of road rage. To top it off this last guy only goes a block and turns right off the highway. There was nobody for a long ways behind me, like he couldn't wait 5 seconds until I went by, JEEZ. I pull into the parking lot at work and I'm shaking like a leaf, from angry and from being scared. The only thing I can figure out is that my Fiero turned invisible for awhile. I'm seriously thinking about mounting a .30 caliber machine gun turrent on top my Fiero. Has anyone ever done this mod and if so, how hard is it to do? Maybe a guided rocket system would be better. DAMN!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cooter||06-09-2000||09:53 PM||||I know the feeling! I never really noticed how little respect small cars get until I drive my Suburban. Few people will pull in front of you and it is really easy to clear folks out of the passing lane in the big truck. I hate the morning commute because of so many inconsiderate butt-munchers! Maybe I just need a POS electra 225 to just ram them. Hmmmm. . .  that would make me feel much better.||||reg||1
